<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/6/msa@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "throughout the natural prolongation of the land territory of Malaysia to the outer edge of the continental margin as determined in accordance with section 2b; or"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/6/msa@> .
